flowchart TD

    classDef ui fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#1e40af,color:#fff
    classDef api fill:#0f766e,stroke:#115e59,color:#fff
    classDef ai fill:#7c2d12,stroke:#9a3412,color:#fff
    classDef ext fill:#4b5563,stroke:#6b7280,color:#fff
    classDef db fill:#312e81,stroke:#3730a3,color:#fff

    User([Scientist])
    HW[HypothesisWindow]:::ui
    PW[PlanWindow]:::ui
    RW[ReviewWindow]:::ui
    LW[Library / Guidelines / Docs]:::ui

    User -->|types hypothesis + files| HW
    HW -->|POST /api/uploads/file| Upload[/uploads.file/]:::api
    Upload --> Storage[(Supabase Storage)]:::db

    HW -->|POST /api/experiment/run SSE| Phase1{{Phase 1 SSE}}:::api
    Phase1 --> Validator[Validator Haiku]:::ai
    Validator -- specific --> Classifier[Classifier Haiku]:::ai
    Validator -- vague --> NeedsRefine[/needs_refinement/]:::api
    NeedsRefine --> HW

    Classifier --> LitQC[Lit QC Sonnet]:::ai
    LitQC --> OpenAlex[(OpenAlex API)]:::ext
    OpenAlex --> LitQC
    LitQC --> ExpRow[(experiments + references)]:::db
    LitQC -->|experiment_started + lit_qc| HW
    HW -->|experimentId| Phase2

    Phase2{{Phase 2 POST generate}}:::api
    Phase2 --> LoadAttachments[loadAttachmentsForModel]:::api
    LoadAttachments --> Storage

    Phase2 --> Reagent[Reagent extractor Haiku]:::ai
    Reagent --> TavilyBatch[Tavily catalog batch]:::ext
    TavilyBatch --> Generator[Generator Haiku synthesis]:::ai

    Phase2 --> CorrFetch[getRecentCorrections scope=general]:::api
    CorrFetch --> Corrections[(corrections)]:::db
    CorrFetch --> Generator

    Generator --> Skeptic[Skeptic + Revise Sonnet]:::ai
    Skeptic --> Generator
    Generator --> DraftPlan[(plans v1)]:::db
    Generator -->|plan JSON| PW

    PW -->|POST verify| Phase3{{Phase 3 POST verify}}:::api
    Phase3 --> Verifier[Catalog verifier Sonnet]:::ai
    Verifier --> TavilyVerify[(Tavily recheck)]:::ext
    TavilyVerify --> Verifier
    Verifier --> Confidence[Confidence annotator Haiku]:::ai
    Confidence --> FinalPlan[(plans updated)]:::db
    Confidence --> PW

    PW --> RW
    RW -->|POST /api/corrections| ApplyBranch{scope?}:::api
    ApplyBranch -- experiment --> Reviser[Reviser Haiku edit this plan]:::ai
    Reviser --> FinalPlan
    Reviser -->|revised plan| PW
    ApplyBranch -- general --> Corrections

    LW -->|GET experiments + PATCH title + DELETE| ExpRow
    LW -->|GET guidelines + DELETE| Corrections
